{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":1026,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach","title":"Bathroom Approach"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["MAP"]}]}]},{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach/Story"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["STORY"]}]}]},{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach/Waves","title":"Bathroom Approach/Waves"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["WAVES"]}]}]},{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach/Rewards","title":"Bathroom Approach/Rewards"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["REWARDS"]}]}]}]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["\n\n"]},{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["This is the story subpage for Bathroom Approach. It contains information about the cutscenes and an overview of the story."]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This page contains the official story elements included in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach","title":"Bathroom Approach"},"children":["Bathroom Approach"]}," of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_Revenge_Event","title":"Ducky Revenge Event"},"children":["Ducky Revenge Event"]},". Most of the content is expressed through cutscenes, though some dialogue is important to the storyline."]},"\n\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Story_Overview"},"children":["Story Overview"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The events in this map take place after the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Operation_I.C.E_Event","title":"Operation I.C.E Event"},"children":["Operation I.C.E Event"]},". Based on the calendar present on the map, it would take place on the 9th of April."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Realm","title":"Duck Realm"},"children":["Duck Realm"]}," had its food supplied through a portal, which one day suddenly stopped. As there appears to be no other food source in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Realm","title":"Duck Realm"},"children":["Duck Realm"]},", this lead to the population of mostly ducks to go without food for weeks. Throughout these weeks, ducks would occasionally visit the portal to check if it is back up, sometimes leaving notes on it. In April, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," decides to yet again check to see if the portal works, where he finds out it is still in its broken state. However, he does find an ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["unknown shard"]}," near it."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["After realizing the power that the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["shard"]}," holds, he mobilizes an army of ducks for an attack on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},", which he blames for the portal breaking. In preparation for the attack, multiple ducks create various ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_D00M_III","title":"Ducky D00M III"},"children":["mechs"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bunny_Sentry","title":"Bunny Sentry"},"children":["sentries"]}," which would be used to defeat the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},". One of the mechs would be powered by the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["shard"]}," he found."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["During the preparations, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," detected that a new ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," fragment was in a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Realm","title":"Duck Realm"},"children":["Duck Realm"]},". They dispatched the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pyromancer","title":"Pyromancer"},"children":["Pyromancer"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Soldier","title":"Soldier"},"children":["Soldier"]},", lead by the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]},", to collect the shard and bring it back to one of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S."]}," bases. After finding it using a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," detector, they run into a group of ducks commanded by the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]},", which gets them all into a fight."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["During the fight, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," takes control over the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bunny_Sentry","title":"Bunny Sentry"},"children":["Bunny Sentries"]}," created and uses them to combat the ducks. The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Dispatcher","title":"Dispatcher"},"children":["Dispatcher"]}," also starts looking into why the portal broke, where she finds out it was caused by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Children_of_Exo","title":"Children of Exo"},"children":["Children of Exo"]},"'s recent invasion on ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Outpost_32_(Operation_I.C.E)","title":"Outpost 32 (Operation I.C.E)"},"children":["Outpost 32"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The battle ends with the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]}," defeating either a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," powered ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_D00M_III","title":"Ducky D00M III"},"children":["Ducky D00M III"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Ducky","title":"Nerd Ducky"},"children":["Mecha Bunny"]},", then the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pyromancer","title":"Pyromancer"},"children":["Pyromancer"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Soldier","title":"Soldier"},"children":["Soldier"]}," take away its ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," shard. The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]},", however, decides to approach the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," with the intent of killing him. He eventually spares his life."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Afterwards, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Professor_V","title":"Professor V"},"children":["Professor V"]}," arrives to the dimension. Impressed by ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]},"'s work, she offers him to work alongside her, which he agrees to. Later, she also mentions that the portal has been opened again, providing the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Realm","title":"Duck Realm"},"children":["Duck Realm"]}," with a supply of food again."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwNQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Opening_Cutscene"},"children":["Opening Cutscene"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwNg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwNw"},"children":[]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This cutscene plays when the timer counts down to 0:00 before the match starts. The map has not yet changed, and the player's point of view is changed to a full screen third person view of the cutscene when the cutscene begins."]},"\n\n",{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwPA"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Synopsis"},"children":["Synopsis"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The following summarizes the events shown in the opening cutscene."]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwPg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwPw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Synopsis"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwQQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["A large bathroom populated by ducks is shown. A calendar is shown on the wall which contains multiple writings on it, all about how bread stopped being delivered to the realm. Afterwards, multiple starving ducks are show."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," decides to check on the portal located in the pipes of a toilet to see if bread has started being delivered again. There, he finds out the situation has not changed, however, he does notice a shiny shard buried in trash."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," decides to bring it back to other ducks and showcase his plan. He plans on creating an army of mechs, power the portal with the shard and then attack those who stopped delivering them bread."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Multiple welder ducks then proceed working on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_D00M_III","title":"Ducky D00M III"},"children":["Ducky D00M III"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bunny_Sentry","title":"Bunny Sentry"},"children":["Bunny Sentries"]},". Sometime in the background, not seen in the cutscene, they also work on a giant ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Ducky","title":"Nerd Ducky"},"children":["Mecha Bunny"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["After convincing other ducks to join his cause, he makes a speech to the ducks, which is interrupted by the arrival of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pyromancer","title":"Pyromancer"},"children":["Pyromancer"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Soldier","title":"Soldier"},"children":["Soldier"]},", who arrived here in search of a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," fragment. Their ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," fragment locator lead them to the army of ducks that the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)","title":"Nerd Duck (Story)"},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," created, where they later get into a battle."]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwUg"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Script"},"children":["Script"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The following is a script-based transcription of the events shown in the opening cutscene."]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwVA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwVQ"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Script"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwVw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwWQ"},"children":[{"type":"span","pro